      {
        "does": "Pushing the off-roader along turns all four wheels together and runs the V8 engine: the front and rear differentials drive shafts to a third, central differential, which drives the five-speed gearbox's output; through whichever gear is engaged, the gearbox turns the engine's input shaft, whose 24-tooth gear turns the crankshaft, so the eight pistons go up and down.",
